    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734100/extras/2a66bc4790d0c9cf58f899d8caf74bdd.avif?t=1754291476\" width=615 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734100/extras/33432489d3e1255bed3c0484d2f35086.poster.avif?t=1754291476\" width=614 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734100/extras/33432489d3e1255bed3c0484d2f35086.webm?t=1754291476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734100/extras/33432489d3e1255bed3c0484d2f35086.mp4?t=1754291476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive straight into fast-paced battles with automatic attacks and smooth, intuitive movement. Demon Lord's Career Change makes it easy to get hooked, and there's no need for complex combos or grind-heavy mechanics. Just jump in, unleash chaos, and enjoy the perfect mix of casual fun and strategic depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734100/extras/e3ccdca5a949cd5b50fd2b7dfa8521bd.avif?t=1754291476\" width=615 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734100/extras/ed2b99ddf86948d56cd6b957e68b72d4.poster.avif?t=1754291476\" width=614 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734100/extras/ed2b99ddf86948d56cd6b957e68b72d4.webm?t=1754291476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734100/extras/ed2b99ddf86948d56cd6b957e68b72d4.mp4?t=1754291476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your harem from a cast of stunning, fully voiced heroines, each with unique skills and personalities. Train them, raise their obedience, and unlock new abilities and mind-blowing sex scenes as your influence grows. They don\u2019t just fight for you, they belong to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734100/extras/9dbb6419fe009c2c80b12d8133377555.avif?t=1754291476\" width=615 height=321 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734100/extras/1cd681c027b64720bd87ab8a10f3893e.poster.avif?t=1754291476\" width=614 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734100/extras/1cd681c027b64720bd87ab8a10f3893e.webm?t=1754291476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734100/extras/1cd681c027b64720bd87ab8a10f3893e.mp4?t=1754291476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace a twisted tale of betrayal, revenge, and domination set in a beautifully dark fantasy world. With full Japanese voice acting and mature storytelling, steamy punishment scenes unlock as your girls submit. Why settle for being a hero when making them kneel is much more fun?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734100/extras/2a66bc4790d0c9cf58f899d8caf74bdd.avif?t=1754291476\" width=615 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734100/extras/33432489d3e1255bed3c0484d2f35086.poster.avif?t=1754291476\" width=614 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734100/extras/33432489d3e1255bed3c0484d2f35086.webm?t=1754291476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734100/extras/33432489d3e1255bed3c0484d2f35086.mp4?t=1754291476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive straight into fast-paced battles with automatic attacks and smooth, intuitive movement. Demon Lord's Career Change makes it easy to get hooked, and there's no need for complex combos or grind-heavy mechanics. Just jump in, unleash chaos, and enjoy the perfect mix of casual fun and strategic depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734100/extras/e3ccdca5a949cd5b50fd2b7dfa8521bd.avif?t=1754291476\" width=615 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734100/extras/ed2b99ddf86948d56cd6b957e68b72d4.poster.avif?t=1754291476\" width=614 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734100/extras/ed2b99ddf86948d56cd6b957e68b72d4.webm?t=1754291476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp